xt': ':FACEBOOK TAKES EU TO COURT FOR INVADING PRIVACY'}{'symbol': 'GRMN', 'date': '2020-07-27 14:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Garmin® Issues Statement On Recent Outage', 'text': 'GARMIN® ISSUES STATEMENT ON RECENT OUTAGE.GARMIN LTD - AFFECTED SYSTEMS ARE BEING RESTORED AND NORMAL OPERATION IS EXPECTED SOON.GARMIN LTD - DO NOT EXPECT ANY MATERIAL IMPACT TO OUR OPERATIONS OR FINANCIAL RESULTS BECAUSE OF THIS OUTAGE.GARMIN LTD -  HAVE NO INDICATION THAT ANY CUSTOMER DATA, INCLUDING PAYMENT INFORMATION FROM GARMIN PAY, WAS ACCESSED, LOST OR STOLEN IN RECENT OUTAGE.GARMIN LTD - ANNOUNCED IT WAS VICTIM OF A CYBER ATTACK THAT ENCRYPTED SOME SYSTEMS ON JULY 23, 2020.GARMIN LTD - FUNCTIONALITY OF GARMIN PRODUCTS WAS NOT AFFECTED, OTHER THAN ABILITY TO ACCESS ONLINE SERVICES.GARMIN LTD - AS OUR AFFECTED SYSTEMS ARE RESTORED, WE EXPECT SOME DELAYS AS BACKLOG OF INFORMATION IS BEING PROCESSED.'}{'symbol': 'HAS', 'date': '2020-07-27 09:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Hasbro Reports Q2 Adjusted Earnings Per Share $0.02 Excluding Items', 'text': 'HASBRO REPORTS SECOND QUARTER 2020 FINANCIAL RESULTS.Q2 ADJUSTED EARNINGS PER SHARE $0.02 EXCLUDING ITEMS.Q2 LOSS PER SHARE $0.25.Q2 REVENUE $860.3 MILLION VERSUS REFINITIV IBES ESTIMATE OF $992.2 MILLION.Q2 EARNINGS PER SHARE ESTIMATE $0.23 -- REFINITIV IBES DATA.QTRLY HASBRO GAMING REVENUES UP 11%.QTRLY EONE ENTERTAINMENT REVENUE NEGATIVELY IMPACTED BY LIVE ACTION PRODUCTION SHUTDOWNS.QTRLY EONE ENTERTAINMENT REVENUE NEGATIVELY IMPACTED BY LIVE ACTION PRODUCTION SHUTDOWNS.FACTORIES AND WAREHOUSES NOW OPEN IN NEARLY ALL MARKETS AND POSITIONED TO MEET FULL-YEAR PRODUCT DEMAND REQUIREMENTS.ENDED Q2 WITH $1.0 BILLION IN CASH.HASBRO - REVENUE FROM SHIPMENTS TO BRICK & MORTAR CUSTOMERS AND DELIVERY OF CONTENT TO MEET DEMAND WILL CONTINUE TO BE IMPACTED BY COVID-19 CLOSURES.NOW EXPECTS 2020 CONTENT PRODUCTION CASH SPEND TO BE IN RANGE OF ABOUT $450-$550 MILLION.EXPECT ENVIRONMENT TO IMPROVE IN Q3 AND SETS UP CO TO EXECUTE A "GOOD" HOLIDAY SEASON.REMAIN ON TRACK TO DELIVER AGAINST PLAN OF $130 MILLION IN SYNERGIES BY YEAR-END 2022.LATIN AMERICA REVENUES EXPECTED TO BE REMAIN CHALLENGED IN SECOND HALF OF YEAR.FACTORIES IN CHINA HAVE BEEN OPERATING AT NORMAL LEVELS SINCE EARLY IN Q2, ARE CAUGHT UP ON MISSED PRODUCTION.WALMART, TARGET AND AMAZON WERE COMPANY\'S LARGEST CUSTOMERS IN Q2.U.S., IRELAND AND INDIA LOCATIONS ARE OPERATING AND ANTICIPATE CATCHING UP ON MISSED PRODUCTION BY LATTER PART OF Q3 2020.'}{'symbol': 'HII', 'date': '2020-07-27 10:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Huntington Ingalls Industries Joint Venture Awarded Position On U.S. Department Of Energy Contract', 'text': 'HUNTINGTON INGALLS INDUSTRIES JOINT VENTURE AWARDED POSITION ON U.S. DEPARTMENT OF ENERGY CONTRACT.HUNTINGTON INGALLS INDUSTRIES INC - MULTIPLE AWARD INDEFINITE DELIVERY/INDEFINITE QUANTITY CONTRACT HAS A 10-YEAR ORDERING PERIOD.HUNTINGTON INGALLS INDUSTRIES INC - MULTIPLE AWARD INDEFINITE DELIVERY/INDEFINITE QUANTITY CONTRACT HAS A MAXIMUM ORDERING CEILING OF $3 BILLION.HUNTINGTON INGALLS - U.S. DOE OFFICE OF ENVIRONMENTAL MANAGEMENT AWARDED CONTRACT TO NATIONWIDE REMEDIATION PARTNERS, A JV LED BY HII NUCLEAR.'}{'symbol': 'KMI', 'date': '2020-07-27 14:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Kinder Morgan Inc Files For Potential Mixed Shelf Offering; Size Not Disclosed', 'text': 'KINDER MORGAN INC FILES FOR POTENTIAL MIXED SHELF OFFERING; SIZE NOT DISCLOSED - SEC FILING.'}{'symbol': 'LLY', 'date': '2020-07-27 09:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Zentalis Pharmaceuticals Inc Announces Clinical Collaboration Agreement With Eli Lilly', 'text': 'ZENTALIS PHARMACEUTICALS INC -.ZENTALIS PHARMACEUTICALS - UNDER TERMS, CO IS RESPONSIBLE FOR CONDUCTING STUDY WITH LILLY PROVIDING ALL REQUIRED DOSES OF ABEMACICLIB.ZENTALIS PHARMACEUTICALS INC - MAINTAINS FULL OWNERSHIP OF ZN-C5.ZENTALIS PHARMACEUTICALS -  CLINICAL COLLABORATION AGREEMENT WITH ELI LILLY IN WHICH CO WILL EVALUATE COMBINATION OF ZN-C5 AND VERZENIO.'}{'symbol': 'UAA', 'date': '2020-07-27 11:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Under